===Egypt vs Uruguay===
[[File:2018 FIFA World Cup Group A march EGY-URU - Carlos Sánchez corner.jpg|thumb|Carlos Sánchez's [[corner kick]]]]
The two teams had met only once, a friendly game in 2006 won by Uruguay 2–0.<ref name=Kit3/>

Egypt frustrated Uruguay with a deep defensive line, staying compact, dealing with danger competently and threatening on the counter-attack to maintain the scoreline goalless, nearing the end of the match.<ref>{{cite news |title=Jose Gimenez grabs late winner for Uruguay to break Egyptian hearts |url=https://www.telegraph.co.uk/world-cup/2018/06/15/world-cup-2018-egypt-vs-uruguay-live-score-latest-updates/ |work=The Telegraph |date=15 June 2018}}</ref> [[Luis Suárez]] looked increasingly at a loss but remained prominent in the few opportunities that were created. When he had just the goalkeeper to beat, he dithered too long and allowed [[Mohamed El Shenawy]] to muffle the ball at his feet. With three minutes remaining, [[Edinson Cavani]] pulled rank over his strike partner over a free kick on the edge of the area.<ref>{{cite web |last=Bairner |first=Robin |title=No Salah, no party as Suarez sinks on World Cup return |url=http://www.goal.com/en/news/no-salah-no-party-as-suarez-sinks-on-world-cup-return/1y1h3oiyni4r0152nqtepn8umn |website=Goal.com |date=15 June 2018}}</ref> [[José María Giménez|José Giménez]] headed into the net in the 89th minute as he met [[Carlos Andrés Sánchez|Carlos Sánchez]]'s free-kick from the right to give the South Americans a winning start in Russia.<ref name="BBC 0-1">{{cite web |last=Emons |first=Michael |title=Egypt 0 Uruguay 1 |url=https://www.bbc.com/sport/football/44408321 |work=BBC Sport |date=15 June 2018}}</ref>

Uruguay won their opening match at the World Cup tournament for the first time since [[1970 FIFA World Cup|1970]], when they beat Israel [[1970 FIFA World Cup Group 2#Uruguay vs Israel|2–0]].<ref name="BBC 0-1"/><ref name="EGY-URU recap">{{cite web |url=https://inside.fifa.com/tournaments/mens/worldcup/2018russia/news/pain-for-returning-egypt-as-uruguay-earn-late-win |title=Pain for returning Egypt as Uruguay earn late win |publisher=FIFA |date=15 June 2018 |access-date=15 June 2018 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260520042922/https://inside.fifa.com/tournaments/mens/worldcup/2018russia/news/pain-for-returning-egypt-as-uruguay-earn-late-win |archive-date=20 May 2026}}</ref>

